.TH NCHAT-UI 1 "2026" "nchat-ui" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
nchat-ui \- WhatsApp and Telegram desktop client built on nchat
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nchat-ui
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Desktop chat client that runs nchat's WhatsApp and Telegram backends in-process and
shows them in a window. Accounts are added from the window (QR code or phone number
and code). Accounts, history and settings are shared with the terminal client
\fBnchat\fR(1); only one of them can use the same config directory at a time.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-confdir\fR \fIDIR\fR
Use a different config directory (default ~/.config/nchat).
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-setup\fR
Open the "add account" wizard.
.TP
\fB\-b\fR, \fB\-\-background\fR
Start without a window (top-bar icon and notifications only).
.TP
\fB\-e\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Verbose logging to <confdir>/log.txt.
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-remove\fR
Remove an account (prompts in the terminal).
.TP
\fB\-x\fR, \fB\-\-export\fR \fIDIR\fR
Export the message cache to DIR.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Show version information.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help.
.SH FILES
~/.config/nchat/ (accounts and history), ~/.config/nchat-ui/settings.conf (UI settings),
~/.config/autostart/nchat-ui.desktop (start at login).
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBnchat\fR(1)
